    "description": "<p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a></i> </p><p>A&nbsp;5th-Degree&nbsp;or&nbsp;Class Five Droid&nbsp;is a&nbsp;Droid&nbsp;programmed for menial and low-skill tasks. Such Droids tend to perform basic tasks such as lifting, maintenance,&nbsp;mining, sanitation, and transportation. </p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"5th-Degree_Droid_Traits\">5th-Degree Droid Traits</span></h3><p>5th-Degree Droids have the following traits: </p><ul>\n <li><b>Ability Modifiers:</b> All 5th-Degree Droids receive a +4 bonus to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a>, but suffer -4 penalties to both their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>.</li> \n <li><b>Behavioral Inhibitors:</b> 5th-Degree Droids firstly cannot knowingly harm a sentient creature, unless another creature would be harmed due to inaction. 5th-Degree Droids secondly obey orders from their designated owner (whether that be an actual owner or themselves).</li> \n <li><b>Droid Traits:</b> All 5th-Degree Droids posses <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid_Traits\" title=\"Droid Traits\">Droid Traits</a>.</li> \n <li><b>Droid Talents:</b> All 5th-Degree Droids can select <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid_Talents\" title=\"Droid Talents\">Droid Talents</a> from the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/5th-Degree_Droid_Talent_Tree\" title=\"5th-Degree Droid Talent Tree\">5th-Degree Droid Talent Tree</a>.</li>\n</ul><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/ASP_Labor_Droid\" title=\"ASP Labor Droid\">ASP Labor Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Additional_5th-Degree_Droids\">Additional 5th-Degree Droids</span></h2><p>The below details all 5th-Degree Droid Models found within the <i>Star Wars Saga Edition</i> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reference_Books\" title=\"Reference Books\">Reference Books</a>. </p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Threats_of_the_Galaxy\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Threats of the Galaxy\">Threats of the Galaxy</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE <p>LEVEL </p> </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/EG-6_Power_Droid\" title=\"EG-6 Power Droid\">EG-6 Power Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/EVS_Construction_Droid\" title=\"EVS Construction Droid\">EVS Construction Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 8 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/GRZ-6B_Demolitions_Droid\" title=\"GRZ-6B Demolitions Droid\">GRZ-6B Demolitions Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 8 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/PK_Worker_Droid\" title=\"PK Worker Droid\">PK Worker Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>Droids play an important part in any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Old_Republic_Campaign\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Old Republic Campaign\">Old Republic Campaign</a>. Droids are just as prominent during the days of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Old_Republic\" title=\"The Old Republic\">The Old Republic</a> as they are in later years, and many models are the obvious predecessors of Droids used during the Galactic Civil War. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/R-8009_Utility_Droid\" title=\"R-8009 Utility Droid\">R-8009 Utility Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/S6-Series_Security/Maintenance_Droid\" title=\"S6-Series Security/Maintenance Droid\">S6-Series Security/Maintenance Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/T1_Bulk_Loader_Droid\" title=\"T1 Bulk Loader Droid\">T1 Bulk Loader Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/MSE-6_Repair_Droid\" title=\"MSE-6 Repair Droid\">MSE-6 Repair Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Scum_and_Villainy\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Scum and Villainy\">Scum and Villainy</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/11-17-Series_Mining_Droid\" title=\"11-17-Series Mining Droid\">11-17-Series Mining Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/8D8_Smelting_Operator\" title=\"8D8 Smelting Operator\">8D8 Smelting Operator</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>The Clone Wars saw the rapid development of Droid technology, mainly due to the Separatists' heavy reliance on Droid military units. The&nbsp;Droids&nbsp;presented in this chapter are some of the models found in use in nonmilitary capacities. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/CLL-6_Binary_Load_Lifter\" title=\"CLL-6 Binary Load Lifter\">CLL-6 Binary Load Lifter</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/FA-5_Valet_Droid\" title=\"FA-5 Valet Droid\">FA-5 Valet Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/IW-37_Pincer_Loader_Droid\" title=\"IW-37 Pincer Loader Droid\">IW-37 Pincer Loader Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>The following&nbsp;Droids&nbsp;are common sights across the galaxy during&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Legacy_Era\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Legacy Era\">The Legacy Era</a>. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/HV-7_Loading_Droid\" title=\"HV-7 Loading Droid\">HV-7 Loading Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>Labor Droids, Maintenance Droids, and Custodial Droids fall into the category of 5th-Degree Droids. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/IC-M_General_Utility_Droid\" title=\"IC-M General Utility Droid\">IC-M General Utility Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galaxy_at_War\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Galaxy_at_War\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Galaxy at War\">Galaxy at War</a></span></h3><p>Although soldiers are loath to admit it, Droids can be invaluable assets in battle, whether as support or as front-line combatants. Even in eras when Droids are less common or distrusted- such as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Dark_Times\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Dark Times\">The Dark Times</a>- they are still utilized in some fashion. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/CLL-M2_Ordnance_Lifter\" title=\"CLL-M2 Ordnance Lifter\">CLL-M2 Ordnance Lifter</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/MR-200-Series_Minesweeper_Droid\" title=\"MR-200-Series Minesweeper Droid\">MR-200-Series Minesweeper Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td><i>Image Unavailable</i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span id=\"Scavenger.27s_Guide_to_Droids\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Scavenger's_Guide_to_Droids\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/8D_Smelter_Droid\" title=\"8D Smelter Droid\">8D Smelter Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/BLX_Labor_Droid\" title=\"BLX Labor Droid\">BLX Labor Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/GD16-Series_Pilot_Droid\" title=\"GD16-Series Pilot Droid\">GD16-Series Pilot Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 5 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/KM1_Mining_Droid\" title=\"KM1 Mining Droid\">KM1 Mining Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/PLNK-Series_Power_Droid\" title=\"PLNK-Series Power Droid\">PLNK-Series Power Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/RO-D_Droid\" title=\"RO-D Droid\">RO-D Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 3 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/XLT-014_Labor_Droid\" title=\"XLT-014 Labor Droid\">XLT-014 Labor Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unknown_Regions\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unknown_Regions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unknown Regions\">Unknown Regions</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/F1_Exploration_Droid\" title=\"F1 Exploration Droid\">F1 Exploration Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 3 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/MULE_Droid\" title=\"MULE Droid\">MULE Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wanderer_Scout_Surveyor_Droid\" title=\"Wanderer Scout Surveyor Droid\">Wanderer Scout Surveyor Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dawn_of_Defiance\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dawn of Defiance\">Dawn of Defiance</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/PK-2M_Mining_Droid\" title=\"PK-2M Mining Droid\">PK-2M Mining Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td><i>Image Unavailable</i> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/XK-V8_Excavation_Droid\" title=\"XK-V8 Excavation Droid\">XK-V8 Excavation Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td><i>Image Unavailable</i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Homebrew_5th-Degree_Droids\">Homebrew 5th-Degree Droids</span></h2><table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#00008B;\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> guidelines. Whether or not it can be used is, as always, the prerogative of the Gamemaster.</b></i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p>The following are a collection of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> 5th-Degree Droid Models created through <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a>. Their use may only be permitted with the express permission of the Gamemaster. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/GNK-Series_Power_Droid\" title=\"GNK-Series Power Droid\">GNK-Series Power Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/RT_Sifter_Droid\" title=\"RT Sifter Droid\">RT Sifter Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
